ave money on the table like I did.\n\nJoyce… : Trading goes against human nature, investing is about having vision. If you try to avoid every dip, you won't get to share in the gains when it rises.\n\nView more comments...\n\nKipbana\n12h\n[Alert] Widespread Gambling: Current Stakes\n$NASDAQ (NASDAQ.US)$ $Dow Jones Industrial Average (.DJI.US)$ $Nasdaq Composite Index (.IXIC.US)$\n $Gold Futures (DEC6) (GCmain.US)$\n $Korea Composite Index (.KOSPI.KR)$ $E-mini S&P 500 Futures (DEC6) (ESmain.US)$ $E-mini NASDAQ 100 Futures (DEC6) (NQmain.US)$ $Invesco QQQ Trust (QQQ.US)$ $PHLX Semiconductor Index (.SOX.US)$ $Nikkei 225 (.N225.JP)$ $Hang Seng Index (800000.HK)$\nBasically the gamblers are back! You can see that they are gambling again.\nThey are gambling what...\n13\nKipbana\n15h\nTrump’s Veto Power for AI?\n$NASDAQ (NASDAQ.US)$ $Dow Jones Industrial Average (.DJI.US)$ $Nasdaq Composite Index (.IXIC.US)$\n $Gold Futures (DEC6) (GCmain.US)$\n $Korea Composite Index (.KOSPI.KR)$ $E-mini S&P 500 Futures (DEC6) (ESmain.US)$ $E-mini NASDAQ 100 Futures (DEC6) (NQmain.US)$ $Invesco QQQ Trust (QQQ.US)$ $PHLX Semiconductor Index (.SOX.US)$ $Nikkei 225 (.N225.JP)$ $Hang Seng Index (800000.HK)$\nSimple explanation so our followers can still stay calm if the market sells off again especially when others go a...\n10\n4\n\nMMM25 : what does this mean ?\n\n70563093 : with enough votes from both sides of the aisle his veto should lose effect. So the question becomes how close will republican congress hold ranks? Maybe Elon will keep paying them not to turn\n\nKipbana OP  70563093 : Nonsense. Why would Republicans veto Trump’s veto? Utter rubbish\n\n106962603 : Some investors have started quietly accumulating positions at the bottom.\n\nKipbana\n23h\n[Accurate] Market lacks rationality: Nikkei and KOPSI\n$NASDAQ (NASDAQ.US)$ $Dow Jones Industrial Average (.DJI.US)$ $Nasdaq Composite Index (.IXIC.US)$\n $Gold Futures (DEC6) (GCmain.US)$\n $Korea Composite Index (.KOSPI.KR)$ $E-mini S&P 500 Futures (DEC6) (ESmain.US)$ $E-mini NASDAQ 100 Futures (DEC6) (NQmain.US)$ $Invesco QQQ Trust (QQQ.US)$ $PHLX Semiconductor Index (.SOX.US)$ $Nikkei 225 (.N225.JP)$ $Hang Seng Index (800000.HK)$\nLike we have wrote yesterday (Indiscriminate Selling Continues: Market lacks rationality) ...\n Midterms: Congress Turns Blue. What’s Your Next Trade?\n8\n6\n3\n\n杨哥  Maniac Fool : Could you share your insights on the underlying dynamics? Any guidance on how long this downturn might last?\n\nKipbana OP  杨哥 : Factually, when calculate based on stats, the markets actually performed better under Democrats. We will update the post to reflect that. Democrats have no reason to tank the markets but the market right now is overly sensitive\n\n小特朗普  Kipbana OP : u mean US market or Asia market?\n\nKipbana OP  小特朗普 : No logical analysis would try to correlate both markets, and like what we have wrote, a lot of Trump’s solutions for the Asian markets are remedies for his own destruction. We don’t engage in speculations.\n\n小特朗普  Kipbana OP : So do you mean in generally Democrats would do better job for the markets?\n\nView more comments...\n\niroh investor\nYesterday 13:42\n$Credo Technology (CRDO.US)$ going down, wall street bois easy predict move . going ding dong\nRead more\nMarket Insights\nStar Tech Companies\nFeatured Tech Stocks represent leading technology companies with strong market presence, influential in their industries, and notable for robust innovation and profitability. These firms are market leaders, significantly affecting the tech sector and broader economy.\nNo.\nSymbol\n5D % Chg\nDisney\nDIS\n+9.09%\nNetflix\nNFLX\n+7.10%\nMicrosoft\nMSFT\n+4.67%\n4\nAmazon\nAMZN\n+4.49%\n5\nAlibaba\nBABA\n+4.29%\nSign up to unlock\nView More\nEarnings Season\nWarren Buffett Portfolio\nBuffett's holdings are the latest portfolio from Berkshire Hathaway. Regarded as a top investor, his trades often signal the market and influence the industry.\nNo.\nSymbol\n20D % Chg\nMoody's